	(text_box "3 X dual channel motor drivers - L6226QTR\n\nEach has separate input - jumper to link input rails\nOutput side, present source voltage and ground for independent channels\n\nOutput modes\n\n0 - switching\n1 - TBD\n2 - independent high is on\n3 - independent low is on\n\n2 bits per driver, 6 bits total\n\nInput mode\nWS2812 / SPI\nRGB / Single\n\n2 bits\n\nRGB converts the RGB into a brightness, IE 12 virtual RGB lights map to the 12 outputs\nSingle, each input channel controls an output, IE 4 virtual RGBe will map to the 12 output channels\n\n12 output pins\n8 config pins\n3 SPI (possibly 4 if we need chip select)\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 130.81 0)
		(size 73.66 62.23)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
