	(text "MAIN_IN (12-50 V) = Data_In pin 4 or Main_In terminal, diode-OR-ed (reverse-polarity protection).\nTVS is DNP: fit SMBJ28A only on 12-24 V builds (no TVS can protect 60 V parts above ~33 V).\nF1 protects the Data_Out pin 4 pass-through."
